#
# Upstream GatherBuddyReborn consumes ElliLib and ElliCon as git SUBMODULES (see .gitmodules),
# both declared net10 / Dalamud.NET.Sdk 15. The TC tree vendors hand-retargeted api13 source for
# each (net9 + Microsoft.NET.Sdk + explicit Dalamud <Reference> block, incl. Serilog/ImGuiScene
# which the SDK used to supply implicitly). A refresh must NOT overwrite them from upstream:
# `git archive` does not descend into submodule gitlinks, so an unguarded first-port/refresh
# would leave ElliLib/ and ElliCon/ EMPTY and the whole tree would stop compiling.
#
# Two files in ElliLib also carry hand fixes that are invisible upstream:
#   Widgets/IndividualHelpers.cs  ObjectKind.Mount -> MountType  (api15 renamed the member)
#   Text/ImUtf8.SliderAngle.cs    re-encoded cp1252 -> UTF-8     (raw 0xB0 degree sign; Roslyn
#                                 under Microsoft.NET.Sdk reads source as UTF-8 and errors CS1039)
ElliLib/*
ElliCon/*

# The SDK-10 compiler is required for the C# 14 `extension` blocks ElliLib/ElliCon use; the TFM
# stays net9.0-windows. Same arrangement as TC_forward/AutoHook and TC_forward/ffxiv_bossmod.
